This is Shutetsu's famous tactic!

29
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:07,210
Forward Kisugi-kun is on the attack!

30
00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:10,460
Will the first goal be Shutetsu's?!

31
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:12,880
Blocked!

32
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:15,800
Nankatsu blocked the shot!

33
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,680
Damn...

34
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,430
An amazing dribble.

35
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:22,520
Shutetsu can't even touch the ball!

36
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,390
Hey, Tsubasa!

37
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:27,270
Ishizaki-kun!

38
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:30,110
Tsubasa, why aren't you coming?

39
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:32,820
This match was supposed to be a battle between you and me.

40
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:33,900
I got the pass!

41
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:36,150
Why are you passing to Ishizaki?

42
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:39,320
Take that, Wakabayashi!

43
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:43,490
Why aren't you coming, Tsubasa?!

44
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:47,210
Boys!

45
00:01:47,210 --> 00:01:48,870
Our opponent is only Tsubasa!

46
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:50,330
Score goals quickly!

47
00:01:50,330 --> 00:01:52,800
Our goal in this match is 50 goals!

48
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:57,510
Tsubasa. Bring it on.

49
00:01:57,970 --> 00:02:02,970
Wakabayashi-kun, this is a battle between you and me.

