74
00:03:35,690 --> 00:03:41,740
Episode 7: Amazing Tsubasa
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE

75
00:03:35,690 --> 00:03:41,740
The 26th soccer match between Shutetsu Elementary and Nankatsu Elementary is underway.

76
00:03:42,070 --> 00:03:45,320
So far, it's a complete tie.

77
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:49,330
The outcome will be decided by this soccer match.

78
00:03:49,330 --> 00:03:52,960
Push! Push! Tsubasa-kun!

79
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:55,790
While the first half continues goalless...

80
00:03:55,790 --> 00:04:01,050
...Shutetsu captain Wakabayashi-kun demanded 50 goals be scored!

81
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:04,260
Shutetsu continues its attacks to make that happen!

82
00:04:07,260 --> 00:04:08,060
Taki!

83
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,060
Got it, let's go!

84
00:04:12,060 --> 00:04:13,560
These are just Nankatsu.

85
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,900
50 goals...

86
00:04:15,690 --> 00:04:17,400
...child's play!

87
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,650
Damn it!

88
00:04:20,530 --> 00:04:22,280
Taki-kun sends the ball again.

89
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:25,570
Alright, the first goal is coming!

90
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,580
I see the goal.

91
00:04:29,450 --> 00:04:31,000
Izawa-kun from Shutetsu...

92
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,580
...aims for the goal with a mid-range shot!

93
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:36,540
The goalkeeper jumps hopelessly but won't reach it!

94
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,710
That's it!

95
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:41,710
Wow! He saved it!

96
00:04:41,710 --> 00:04:43,340
He saved it again!

97
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:47,350
Although the national champions Shutetsu Elementary...

98
00:04:47,350 --> 00:04:49,810
...are a team very proud of their attacks...

99
00:04:49,810 --> 00:04:51,390
...they still haven't scored!

100
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:58,310
And their opponents are Nankatsu Elementary, whom they beat 30-0 in a practice match!

101
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:03,190
The national tournament champion Shutetsu Elementary is being humiliated by a single person!

102
00:05:04,070 --> 00:05:05,070
Take that!

103
00:05:05,650 --> 00:05:08,890
There is an amazing person standing on the field...

104
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:10,240
...and that person's name...

105
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:15,370
...is Nankatsu's number 10, Ozora Tsubasa-kun!

106
00:05:15,370 --> 00:05:18,000
And now he defended the goal with an overhead kick!

107
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,420
Tsubasa!

108
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:20,540
That's it.

109
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:24,050
Hooray! Hooray! Tsubasa!

110
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:26,880
Shutetsu couldn't even score a single goal.

111
00:05:27,890 --> 00:05:30,180
So that's Ozora Tsubasa.

112
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:31,560
A pretty good center-back.

113
00:05:32,850 --> 00:05:35,810
He's not actually a center-back.

114
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:41,610
The precision of his shots, his ability to read the ball's course, and his game intuition.

115
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:44,940
Could it be that he...

116
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:47,530
Everyone, try a little harder!

117
00:05:47,530 --> 00:05:49,280
Don't leave everything to Tsubasa!

118
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:49,870
Yes.

119
00:05:50,990 --> 00:05:52,160
Here, Taki!

120
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:56,080
Let's score the first goal!

121
00:05:56,460 --> 00:05:59,130
Nankatsu is only their number 10.

122
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:01,460
Keep attacking until we succeed!

123
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:02,210
Yes!

124
00:06:02,210 --> 00:06:04,210
Do you think we'll allow it?!

125
00:06:04,210 --> 00:06:06,970
Shutetsu attacks!

126
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,390
Move!

127
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:18,890
I won't let you!

128
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,690
These guys...

129
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:26,650
We got past them easily last time.

130
00:06:29,490 --> 00:06:32,280
We can't let them get past us that easily!

131
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:35,660
We practiced so much with Coach Roberto!

132
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:39,540
Oh no!

133
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:42,920
Nakazato-kun from Nankatsu clears the ball!

134
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:45,090
Nankatsu escapes a difficult situation again!

135
00:06:45,590 --> 00:06:48,920
10 minutes of the 20-minute half have passed like water...

136
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,090
...and there's still no goal in the match!

137
00:06:53,890 --> 00:06:56,770
What are you doing?!

138
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,850
That's it, just as we planned.

139
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:03,900
We'll have Tsubasa play defense to keep the first half goalless and...

140
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:05,860
...we'll make our move in the second half.

141
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:07,940
Kisugi!

142
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,200
Shutetsu's goal-getter Kisugi-kun...

143
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:12,740
...advances into Nankatsu's half with his well-known dribbling!

144
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:15,950
I'm Shutetsu's goal scorer...

145
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:18,660
...it's a complete disgrace that I still haven't scored!

146
00:07:20,750 --> 00:07:24,920
He cut the ball again with a lightning slide!

147
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,590
Thanks to the great efforts of Nankatsu's Ozora Tsubasa-kun...

148
00:07:27,590 --> 00:07:29,800
...Shutetsu still hasn't scored!

149
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:34,470
The reason Shutetsu hasn't scored isn't just Nankatsu's number 10.

150
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:37,310
Everyone, you can push up a little more.

151
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:40,810
Alright! Let's push up a little more.

152
00:07:40,810 --> 00:07:42,480
Thanks to the number 10...

153
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,730
...the other players are playing fearlessly.

154
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:52,070
By playing their best player at center-back, the Nankatsu coach...

155
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:56,740
...has established team balance.

156
00:07:57,330 --> 00:08:00,040
Tsubasa isn't the only reason we can't score.

157
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:04,790
Ishizaki's group is also playing unexpectedly well.

158
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:06,250
In just a few weeks...

159
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:08,880
...how did they get this good when they were so terrible?

160
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:11,010
Hey! Push yourselves harder!

161
00:08:11,010 --> 00:08:14,590
Come on, Tsubasa! Do your best!

162
00:08:14,590 --> 00:08:16,850
How's the little soccer player doing?

163
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:23,140
Tsubasa-kun blocks it again!

164
00:08:23,140 --> 00:08:24,560
Ishizaki-kun!

165
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:26,860
Alright!

166
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:30,940
A long pass from Tsubasa-kun to Ishizaki-kun!

167
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:34,360
Nankatsu's game depends on this counter-attack!

168
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,160
Will they be able to make use of this opportunity?

169
00:08:37,950 --> 00:08:41,620
What?! Goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun is running towards the ball!

170
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:42,540
Captain!

171
00:08:42,540 --> 00:08:43,660
What?!

172
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:47,250
Wakabayashi-kun cuts the ball with a slide!

173
00:08:47,250 --> 00:08:48,420
Ishizaki-kun!

174
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:50,760
Tsubasa!

175
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:53,420
Wakabayashi-kun got tense.

176
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:55,470
He sends a long ball.

177
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:57,850
But the ball...

178
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:03,350
...goes directly to his rival Tsubasa-kun.

179
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:08,270
It's very rare for Wakabayashi-kun to send a pass to the wrong place!

180
00:09:08,690 --> 00:09:11,030
Tsubasa, bring it on!

181
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:19,990
This is a challenge from Wakabayashi-kun.

182
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,830
We've entered injury time.

183
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:25,370
Alright.

184
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:33,090
He's started dribbling!

185
00:09:33,090 --> 00:09:35,720
Tsubasa-kun, who had been defending until now...

186
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,840
...suddenly started running towards the opponent's goal!

187
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:40,720
Tsubasa, stick to the plan!

188
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:46,350
It's impossible to expect Tsubasa to only defend, isn't it?

189
00:09:46,350 --> 00:09:48,350
C-Captain!

190
00:09:48,350 --> 00:09:51,440
Tsubasa's soccer isn't defense soccer.

191
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,900
It's goal-scoring soccer.

192
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:56,490
That's it, keep going!

193
00:09:56,950 --> 00:10:00,450
Come on, Tsubasa!

194
00:10:00,450 --> 00:10:02,450
What? Dad...

195
00:10:02,450 --> 00:10:05,540
You bastard! Are you even looking outside?!

196
00:10:07,870 --> 00:10:09,170
What?

197
00:10:11,170 --> 00:10:15,300
Amazing! No one can stop Tsubasa-kun's advance!

198
00:10:15,300 --> 00:10:16,050
That's it.

199
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:17,930
Oh, that Tsubasa.

200
00:10:17,930 --> 00:10:20,550
Of course, attacking is also a form of defense.

201
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:22,180
We'll try everything we can!

202
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:24,720
That's it! This match...

203
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:29,600
...was supposed to be a battle between Ozora Tsubasa and Wakabayashi Genzo!

204
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:32,360
Come on, Tsubasa-kun!

205
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,860
I'm coming, Wakabayashi-kun!

206
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,070
Bring it on, Tsubasa!

207
00:10:41,070 --> 00:10:43,030
Tsubasa took a mid-range shot!

208
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:45,200
I-Its course...

209
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:48,410
Wakabayashi-kun deflects it!

210
00:10:51,330 --> 00:10:54,050
A great shot and a great save!

211
00:10:54,050 --> 00:10:56,420
The duo put on a wonderful show!

212
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:58,470
Amazing! If you had shot with your right foot...

213
00:10:58,470 --> 00:11:00,760
...it would have definitely gone in.

214
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:03,390
Damn! I couldn't catch it!

215
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:07,770
Even though Wakabayashi-kun made a great save...

216
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:10,060
...considering he took that shot...

217
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:14,150
...Ozora Tsubasa-kun must be a forward.

218
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:20,320
Nankatsu will take a corner kick.

219
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,660
And the one taking it is Tsubasa-kun!

220
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:24,780
Tsubasa is taking the corner?

221
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:26,330
Where will he send it?

222
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,420
Listen, Tsubasa.

223
00:11:34,710 --> 00:11:39,300
When you hit it with the front of your foot, strike slightly outside the center of the ball and...

224
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,260
...curve it!

225
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:44,140
Tsubasa-kun took the corner kick!

226
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:45,550
Got it!

227
00:11:45,550 --> 00:11:47,260
He sent it to Ishizaki!

228
00:11:51,730 --> 00:11:54,270
No way! It curved!

229
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:57,530
Tsubasa curved it and aimed directly for the goal!

230
00:11:58,030 --> 00:12:01,860
Wakabayashi-kun is reaching out with his fingertips!

231
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:02,780
That's it!

232
00:12:02,780 --> 00:12:04,410
It passed!

233
00:12:04,410 --> 00:12:06,780
Wakabayashi-kun can't reach it!

234
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,910
But the ball hits the post!

235
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,670
The first half ends here!

236
00:12:16,670 --> 00:12:23,510
Tsubasa-kun's corner kick was really close to scoring!

237
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:26,720
The score is still 0-0.

238
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,520
A very good game was displayed.

239
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,730
What an amazing curve.

240
00:12:31,730 --> 00:12:34,270
I don't even know if I could do that.

241
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:36,650
There you are, Tsubasa.

242
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:40,740
He used the newly learned curving shot at such an important moment.

243
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,660
Dad!

244
00:12:50,330 --> 00:12:51,790
Captain...

245
00:12:52,870 --> 00:12:55,330
He got past me.

246
00:12:57,980 --> 00:13:02,990
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

247
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:06,890
How was it, Tsubasa?

248
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:08,260
Were you surprised?

249
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:09,390
Yes.

250
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:13,890
Because you never said you were coming, Dad.

251
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:17,520
So Tsubasa's father has returned.

252
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:21,070
Everyone, thank you for taking care of Tsubasa.

253
00:13:21,070 --> 00:13:22,780
No need to thank us...

254
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:23,860
What's with the attitude?

255
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:27,820
Everyone, you did a great job in the first half.

256
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:29,120
Yes.

257
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,290
Tsubasa, that was really close.

258
00:13:31,290 --> 00:13:33,580
You were about to score.

259
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:35,290
Let's just put this behind us.

260
00:13:35,290 --> 00:13:40,340
Put it behind us and let's celebrate ending the first half goalless against Shutetsu for the first time.

261
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:42,420
Yes, exactly!

262
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:46,430
But there was someone who ignored our plan.

263
00:13:46,430 --> 00:13:47,590
Tsubasa.

264
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:52,430
I used to ignore the coach's plan in the past too.

265
00:13:52,430 --> 00:13:53,180
