Everyone.

269
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:05,740
Football is a game you play by making your own decisions.

270
00:14:05,740 --> 00:14:08,570
From now on, I want you to value your own decisions.

271
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:09,450
